 #!/usr/bin/env bun
 /**
- * Focused test for nvidia/nemotron-nano-9b-v2
+ * Iterative nemotron-nano-9b-v2 test with 3x runs, failure categorization, observability.
+ * Runs 6 questions × 3 = 18 invocations per iteration.
+ * 10-minute wall clock timeout.
+ * Emits per-run traces for debugging.
  */

